  title: Reading Recommendations
  content: "Recommended Reading for New Researchers\n\n\u2022 Plant Life of the Northern
    Valleys\n\u2022 A Beginner's Guide to Field Observation\n\u2022 The History of
    Frostmere\n\u2022 Cataloguing Ancient Manuscripts\n\u2022 Maps Through the Ages\n\nRemember:\nA
    well-read researcher asks better questions, not necessarily more of them.\n\n\u2014
    Edwin Hartwell"
